-- lengths
LengthKnown(5) LengthUnknown True
ContentLength(3) Chunked UntilClose
-- known length
exact: ok, 3 writes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ncontent-length: 11\r\n\r\nhello world
empty: ok, 1 writes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ncontent-length: 0\r\n\r\n
past the length: more body was written than the length declared, 0 writes
  
short of the length: the message ended before its framing said it would, 1 writes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ncontent-length: 10\r\n\r\nhello
overrun ignored: more body was written than the length declared, 0 writes
  
-- unknown length
chunked: ok, 4 writes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ntransfer-encoding: chunked\r\n\r\n5\r\nhello\r\n1\r\n \r\n5\r\nworld\r\n0\r\n\r\n
flushed: ok, 5 writes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ntransfer-encoding: chunked\r\n\r\n9\r\ndata: 1\n\n\r\n9\r\ndata: 2\n\n\r\n0\r\n\r\n
nothing written: ok, 1 writes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ntransfer-encoding: chunked\r\n\r\n0\r\n\r\n
-- the function fails
chunked, not ended: the feed went away, 1 writes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ntransfer-encoding: chunked\r\n\r\n7\r\npartial
known, not ended: the feed went away, 1 writes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ncontent-length: 10\r\n\r\npart
-- the connection fails
after the first write: Transport(write: broken pipe), 1 writes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ntransfer-encoding: chunked\r\n\r\n3\r\none
-- after the message ended
kept the sink: ok, 2 writes
  HTTP/1.1 200 OK\r\ntransfer-encoding: chunked\r\n\r\n1\r\nx\r\n0\r\n\r\n
late write: IOError Closed
late flush: IOError Closed
